# Data & large binary formats
*.h5ad
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.loom
*.mtx
*.csv
*.tsv
# ...but keep R/conda package manifests (env specs, not data)
!Rpackages_*.csv
# ...and the scGPT Ensembl->symbol gene map (static asset the scGPT embed needs)
!scGPT/gene_info.csv
# ...and the repair-pilot RESULT TABLES. They live on /oscar/scratch, which is
# purge-eligible and disappears with cluster access, and they are the one artifact
# that cannot be regenerated without a GPU. Weights, embedding caches, and h5ads
# stay ignored -- those rebuild from the code in pipeline/pilot/.
!results/
!results/**/*.csv
!results/**/*.json
!results/**/*.md
!results/**/*.out
# ...and the paper's exact scDesign3 BalancedAugmented pilots (stochastic step, shipped
# for bit-exact reproduction — see reproduce.sh / CONTAINER.md)
!pilots/
!pilots/*.h5ad
*.parquet
*.feather
*.npy
*.npz

